Owner profile

Deep link
/settings/profile

Pair with blueprint
	•	owner_username
	•	owner_handle
	•	owner_bio
	•	visual_asset_direction.owner_profile_image

Show in dashboard
	•	Suggested display name
	•	Suggested bio
	•	Suggested profile image direction

Can this be auto-injected?
Yes, mostly. Mastodon’s documented account API supports updating profile data with PATCH /api/v1/accounts/update_credentials, including display_name, note (bio), avatar, header, and some profile preferences.  ￼

