Can this be auto-injected?
Probably not via the official public REST API. In the current official Mastodon API docs, the documented admin REST surface includes things like accounts, domain blocks, reports, trends, and related admin resources, but I do not see documented write endpoints for branding/settings pages.  ￼
So for MVP, treat branding as manual UI paste/upload.

