Can this be auto-injected?
Not via the documented public REST API. The official announcements API docs only document viewing announcements plus dismissing/reacting to them as a user; they do not document an admin “create announcement” REST endpoint. The admin docs describe creating announcements in the web UI under Administration → Announcements.  ￼
So for MVP: manual UI paste.

