Can this be auto-injected?
Yes. Mastodon’s documented statuses API supports creating statuses with POST /api/v1/statuses, and the documented pin endpoint supports pinning your own status with POST /api/v1/statuses/:id/pin.  ￼
This is one of the strongest candidates for later automation.

