2. Practical conclusion: what can be automated soonest

Strong candidates for official API automation

These are the best early wins:
	•	Owner profile
	•	bio / display name / avatar / header via PATCH /api/v1/accounts/update_credentials  ￼
	•	Launch posts
	•	create via POST /api/v1/statuses  ￼
	•	Pin posts
	•	via POST /api/v1/statuses/:id/pin  ￼
	•	Domain blocks
	•	if needed, via POST /api/v1/admin/domain_blocks  ￼

Best treated as manual UI for MVP

Because I could not verify documented public REST write endpoints for them:
	•	registrations
	•	branding
	•	about page
	•	announcements creation
	•	rules
	•	discovery settings
	•	invite creation
	•	tag setup  ￼

That makes your current dashboard strategy exactly right:
deep link + copy block + mark done

